flowchart LR
    subgraph Model["GLM-5.1 model rank"]
        H["Post-attention hidden rows"] --> G["GateLinear"]
        G --> R["Grouped top-k router"]
    end

    R --> IDs["Global topk_ids\nand topk_weights"]
    IDs --> Map["ExpertMapManager\nglobal -> local IDs"]
    H --> Prep["Quantize + prepare"]
    Map --> Prep

    Prep --> Dispatch["EP dispatch\nall-gather or specialized A2A"]

    subgraph Experts["EP ranks, one local expert shard per rank"]
        Dispatch --> Local["Local expert MLPs\nw13 -> SiLU -> w2"]
    end

    Local --> Finalize["Weighted finalize + EP combine"]
    Finalize --> Out["Source-token ordered\nMoE output"]
    Out --> Next["Residual stream\nnext decoder operation"]
